Bug fix: voting timer paused by default on transition to voting screen.

This commit modifies 7 files (+218/-55 lines), spanning 4 Markdown docs, 1 other, 1 game server.
This fix addresses a reported bug or regression in the game. Bug fixes in this project follow the TDD protocol: a failing test was written first to reproduce the issue, then the fix was applied to make the test pass, ensuring the defect cannot silently regress.

Additional context from the commit body:
User reported regression: timer was running instead of paused when voting screen appeared.
Root cause: transitionToVoting() was setting countdownPaused = false instead of true.
Changed server/rooms/GameRoom.ts line 4531 to initialize countdownPaused = true.

This ensures the voting countdown timer starts paused, matching s44m-18 intent.
Host can resume via the RESUME TIMER button.

